.TH CKSUM 1 "Riplix" "Ripple"
.SH NAME
cksum \- print a CRC and character count
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
cksum [file ...]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the standard CRC, character count and filename for each file, or
read standard input when no file is named. Input characters must have
values from 0 to 255. Files containing larger native characters are
rejected, rather than silently discarding the high bits.
